@bank all
// W3, rec deck R12: the News feed's rec dec posts (banks/news.lines' format: one kind per source, 90 characters).
// trad: ids are the rec traditions' proposed ids (content/trad-words/*.words; RA confirms).

== news.works
- Rec dec: pool filter changed. Maeve did it in nine minutes forty. She wants it known.
- Court net back up after a flicker. The Sunday crowd cheered the repair. Works bowed.
- A route's taped off on the climbing wall while a loose hold gets tightened. Sorry, blue.
- Gravity plates checked. The float room is floating exactly as much as it should.

== news.notice
- Rec dec: wet towels in the returns bin, please. Not on the beanbags.
- Kit hire is self-serve. So is putting it back. The sign says so. In capitals.
- Found on the kit hire counter: one flipper. Owner, please collect. It's lonely.
- The rec dec closes at midnight, for Deck 4's sleep. Night swimmers, sorry.
- The season's bell board is in the rec dec foyer. Ring the bell on Wall night to join it.

== news.gossip
- Someone left the float room on "moon" again. We have suspects. We have no proof.
- Chief Holt was seen leaving the float room. Twice. He says it was for his back.
- Overheard on the court: "Pell 11, You banana." The scoreboard needs Works.
- Rina says she's beaten Pell at Lightdisc eleven times. Pell says nine. Ask Rina.

== news.crew
- Commander Vance has rung the climbing wall bell more than anyone. He has the number.
- {name} rang the bell on Wall night. Their name's on the season's board in the foyer.
